{"id":590,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"実学と人格教育を軸に大学連携で学ぶ六年一貫教育","feature_description":"近畿大学附属は、実学教育と人格の陶冶を基盤に、知・徳・体を調和させる六年一貫教育を行います。思考力・判断力・表現力に加え、主体性、多様性、協働性を育てる学びを重視します。英語村やICT活用、近畿大学の医学・薬学部との連携など、専門的な学びに触れる機会も用意しています。大学とのつながりを生かしながら、自ら課題を見つけて行動する力を伸ばす学校です。","clubs":[{"id":11143,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jsh.kindai.ac.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11144,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jsh.kindai.ac.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11145,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jsh.kindai.ac.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11146,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jsh.kindai.ac.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11147,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jsh.kindai.ac.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11148,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jsh.kindai.ac.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11149,"name":"柔道部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jsh.kindai.ac.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11150,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.jsh.kindai.ac.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11151,"name":"英語研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jsh.kindai.ac.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11152,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jsh.kindai.ac.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11153,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jsh.kindai.ac.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11154,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.jsh.kindai.ac.jp/jhs/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11155,"name":"書